@* 规则字段编辑器：名称/描述/条件组/命中动作，供不同弹窗复用（规则库、流程设计器节点配置）。*@
<div class="mb-2">
    <label class="form-label">名称</label>
    <input class="form-control" @bind="Rule.Name" />
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
    <label class="form-label">描述</label>
    <input class="form-control" @bind="Rule.Description" />
</div>

<label class="form-label">条件组（命中即视为规则匹配）</label>
<ConditionGroupEditor Group="Rule.ConditionGroup" />

<label class="form-label mt-2">命中后写回 context 的动作</label>
@foreach (var action in Rule.Actions.ToList())
{
    <div class="row g-2 align-items-center mb-1">
        <div class="col-5">
            <input class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="字段名，如 approver" @bind="action.Field" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-5">
            <input class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="值，如 director" @bind="action.Value" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-2">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" @onclick="() => Rule.Actions.Remove(action)">移除</button>
        </div>
    </div>
}
<button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" @onclick="() => Rule.Actions.Add(new Models.RuleAction())">+ 动作</button>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public Models.RuleDefinition Rule { get; set; } = new();
}
